{"candidateAnswer":"A book related to identity and personal stories","evidence":"[D7:11 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: I loved \"Becoming Nicole\" by Amy Ellis Nutt. It's a real inspiring true story about a trans girl and her family. It made me feel connected and gave me a lot of hope for my own path. Highly recommend it for sure!\n[D17:10 | 10:31 am on 13 October, 2023] Melanie: Thanks, Caroline. It was tough, but I'm doing ok. Been reading that book you recommended a while ago and painting to keep busy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e7e998f6-dcb0-589a-9973-194ff94b9f77","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:aff486670646194516f148cf15d571b1c25d7e5fbddbf29130adc7371acb31cb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What book did Melanie read from Caroline's suggestion?","referenceAnswer":"\"Becoming Nicole\"","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"aff486670646194516f148cf15d571b1c25d7e5fbddbf29130adc7371acb31cb"}}]}